{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281120","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028112001:1":{"text":"魔力を吸収する準備はできています。","source_cn":"我已经准备好吸收散逸的魔力了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x508F7AC8F703F972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1028112001":{"text":"魔力を吸収する準備はできています。","source_cn":"我已经准备好吸收散逸的魔力了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x508F7AC8F703F972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028112002:0":{"text":"ガォ……ガオ……ガオォ！","source_cn":"吼……吼……吼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5610C76A2D206156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028112003:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい……お邪魔でしたか？","source_cn":"对不起……我打扰到你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x401DA76D403ABA8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028112004:0":{"text":"……あら、ケガをしていますね……クマさん、わたしに治させてくれませんか？もっと近くで見ても……？","source_cn":"……咦，你受伤了……熊先生，可以让我来治疗吗？我，能不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E19A95E7CBEC49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028112005:1":{"text":"グオ……","source_cn":"吼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C43CCAC1E8149C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028112006:0":{"text":"ひどいケガ……とても痛かったでしょう……すぐに治しますね。少し雨に濡れてしまいますが……痛みはないので安心してください。","source_cn":"伤得好重，一定很难受吧……我要治疗了，可能会让你淋一点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4AF1BB6EEC776B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028112007:0":{"text":"大丈夫、すぐに終わりますよ……ほら、傷が塞ぎ始めています！","source_cn":"别着急，马上就好……瞧，已经开始愈合了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD990965176CF9AA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028112008:0":{"text":"グォ……グル……","source_cn":"吼……咕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07FE7EB7F6E217BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028112009:0":{"text":"このハチミツは……？わたしに？","source_cn":"这些蜂蜜是……？都是给我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C0F9FB9E0C35FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028112010:0":{"text":"……とても甘い！ありがとう、クマさん！","source_cn":"……真甜！谢谢你，熊先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ABE54886EC21B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028112011:0":{"text":"そうだ、私はイヴォンヌ、あなたのお名前は？","source_cn":"对了，我叫伊温，你有名字吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F4377E4260BA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028112012:1":{"text":"グオ……グ？","source_cn":"吼……呼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C877C41A5AF8828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028112013:0":{"text":"名前がないんですね……なら、「エルゴン」はどうです？エルゴン、森の「大きな仲間」の意味です！","source_cn":"没有名字啊……那我叫你“伊尔贡”好不好？伊尔贡，丛林里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33E8E32798C10161","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028112014:1":{"text":"ガウ！","source_cn":"咕噜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C9F004F6E69CFE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028112015:0":{"text":"これもわたしに？綺麗な葉っぱですね……ありがとう、エルゴン！","source_cn":"这也是送给我的吗？好漂亮的叶子……谢谢，伊尔贡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE5F8FB5C26DACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028112016:0":{"text":"わたしたち……もうお友だち、ですよね？お友だち！","source_cn":"我们……是朋友了，对吧？我们是朋友了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB069F6142468A980","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028112017:1":{"text":"ガゥ……グォ……グルル……","source_cn":"咕噜……吼……咕噜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB18013894A5BDCE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028112018:0":{"text":"わたしに……撫でてほしいのですか？ふふ、モフモフでかわいい……","source_cn":"你想……让我摸摸你？哈，毛绒绒的，好可爱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7F1CF50A03C862E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1028112019:0":{"text":"……あれ、終わりですか？今回は魔物も来なくて順調――","source_cn":"……咦，结束了？这次很顺利嘛，没有魔物来侵扰——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E3CF602A380379B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1028112020:2":{"text":"グオ……ガオオオ！！","source_cn":"吼……噢噢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B46411A3CAD671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1028112020":{"text":"グオ……ガオオオ！！","source_cn":"吼……噢噢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B46411A3CAD671","variant_status":"","